    <string name="About">About KlipPocket</string>
    <string name="IntroTitle">What is KlipPocket?</string>
    <string name="IntroText">KlipPocket brings Klipper to your Android device, turning an old phone or tablet into the brain of your 3D printer.\n\nHighlights:\n• Klipper and Kalico firmware support\n• Up to 10 concurrent instances\n• Native Android timelapse (no FFmpeg)\n• Mainsail, Fluidd and Voyager web interfaces\n• Camera, OctoEverywhere, Obico and Print Recovery\n\n1. Tap \"+\" to create a printer profile.\n2. Tap the Run button to start the engine.\n3. Open Fluidd, Mainsail or Voyager UI to control your printer.\n4. Use settings to switch engines and frontends.\n\nAll processing happens locally on your device.</string>
